{"unit_id":"jcjyids__dsh-web-advanced-settings#card-1","repo":"jcjyids/dsh-web-advanced-settings","commit":"20b66bb253114048deb27ba731f4175cc93837b8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-advanced-listening-settings 是面向 DSH Web 的高级监听设置插件，在设置页新增独立面板。用户可选择仅本机、全部网卡或指定 IPv4 地址监听，调整服务端口、查看并复制访问地址，也可选择关闭 token 鉴权或重启 DSH。指定 IP 模式由插件建立 TCP 转发；绑定地址和端口通过 profile 补丁应用。面板还提供旧配置检查与完全清理。适合需要从局域网访问 Web 界面并管理监听配置的用户；不需要 API 密钥，需使用 DSH web profile。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:550-566","index.js:55-58","index.js:1127-1220","index.js:1500-1588"]}
{"unit_id":"jcjyids__dsh-web-advanced-settings#card-2","repo":"jcjyids/dsh-web-advanced-settings","commit":"20b66bb253114048deb27ba731f4175cc93837b8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-advanced-listening-settings adds a DSH Web panel to choose loopback, all interfaces, or selected IPv4 addresses. Change the port, copy access URLs, toggle token authentication, and restart DSH. It also cleans legacy settings. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:550-566","index.js:1127-1220","index.js:1500-1588"]}
